sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User (browser/phone)
    participant UI as Next.js app
    participant FB as Firebase Auth
    participant API as Cloud Run API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>UI: Sign in (email / phone OTP / Google)
    UI->>FB: Authenticate
    FB-->>UI: ID token (+ custom claims: roles)
    U->>UI: Request (e.g. "my child's grades")
    UI->>API: API call + ID token
    API->>FB: Verify token (Admin SDK)
    FB-->>API: Valid, uid + claims
    API->>DB: Load roles & scopes for uid
    DB-->>API: e.g. guardian of student #42 only
    API->>API: Enforce scope: filter to student #42
    API->>DB: Scoped query
    DB-->>API: Rows
    API-->>UI: Response
    UI-->>U: Render (Tamil/English)

    Note over API,DB: Claims are hints for routing;<br/>the database is the authority.<br/>Every request re-verifies.
